flowchart TD
    NOTE["Behavior review only: physical dependency/readiness schemas<br/>and trigger/claim mechanisms are not approved"]
    START["Scheduled parent workflow"] --> DISC["Reusable source-schema discovery<br/>One full pass per selected table/cycle"]
    DISC --> A{"Table A eligible?"}
    DISC --> B{"Table B eligible?"}
    A -- Yes --> BA["Bronze A<br/>Stage, validate mapped schema, publish captured batch once"]
    B -- Yes --> BB["Bronze B<br/>Stage, validate mapped schema, publish captured batch once"]
    A -- No --> AB["Record blocked source table and reason<br/>Drift/failure policy still under review"]
    B -- No --> BBLOCK["Record blocked source table and reason<br/>Unrelated Bronze work continues"]
    BA --> S1A["Independent Silver 1 A<br/>Normalize, validate, deduplicate, commit"]
    BB --> S1B["Independent Silver 1 B<br/>Normalize, validate, deduplicate, commit"]
    S1A --> READY{"All required upstream datasets committed<br/>with compatible versions and required freshness/coverage?"}
    S1B --> READY
    READY -- Yes --> CLAIM["Atomically claim eligible consumer work<br/>Idempotent effects; mechanism pending"]
    CLAIM --> S2["Silver 2 joined output<br/>Architecture only: not added to current Patient-only build"]
    READY -- No --> BLOCK["BLOCKED_BY_DEPENDENCY<br/>Persist reason and notify; not a failed transformation"]
    BLOCK --> WAIT["Wait for missing/stale dependency to become ready"]
    WAIT --> REEVAL["Automatically reevaluate and dispatch promptly<br/>Do not wait for next scheduled cycle"]
    REEVAL --> READY
    SLA["Separate availability SLA monitoring<br/>Record deadline breach and alert; not an execution veto"]
    BLOCK -. Deadline observations .-> SLA
    S2 -. Availability and time-to-recovery .-> SLA
    SLA -. Preserve original breach after recovery .-> HISTORY["Immutable SLA/recovery evidence"]
    NOTE -. Scope .-> DISC
